364](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 2.55 Cr**\n\nExperience elevated living in this unfurnished 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom Flats located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, available for sale at 2.54 crore.Situated on the 3rd floor of a 9-story building, this 775 square feet residence offers a tranquil garden view and boasts Vastu compliance, ensuring a harmonious living space.The apartment is well-ventilated, promoting a healthy and comfortable environment, and features a luxury\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638970869703076137-2610250249304930.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 2 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638970869701998314-2610250249304930.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638970869703598404-2610250249304930.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Furnished Amenities in 2 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638970869702228098-2610250249304930.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638970869700779269-2610250249304930.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n*![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2052106409102, 72.8390426561236](/assets/images/map-icon.png)*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2052106409102, 72.8390426561236](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.6 Cr**\n\nA bright future awaits in Kandivali West with this unfurnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats, now on sale for 1.6 crore.Located in Mumbai, this 600 square feet home sits on the 5th floor of an 18-story building, offering a pleasant road view. Built within the last 2-4 years, it comes with a dedicated parking spot and access to amenities like kids` play\n\n![Sanket Mehta  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/919823790234638941563760098906.jpg?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in JP Jeevan Asha, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639187632924791643-040726120132132.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.207323, 72.843399*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.207323, 72.843399](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 2 Cr**\n\nExperience urban living at its finest in this furnished two-bedroom, two-bathroom Flats located on the twelfth floor of JP Jeevan Asha in Kandivali West, Mumbai. Priced at 2 crore, this 650 square feet home offers a comfortable and convenient lifestyle with a pleasing road view.The apartment comes equipped with central Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi connectivity, and 24x7 security for your peace of mind,\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Viraj Nidhi Apartment, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639162625040034028-0506260121442144.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Furnished Amenities in 2 BHK Apartment at Viraj Nidhi Apartment, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639162625042501416-0506260121442144.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Staircase in 2 BHK Apartment at Viraj Nidhi Apartment, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639162625047096884-0506260121442144.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.20223667, 72.84260333*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.20223667, 72.84260333](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.1 Cr**\n\nA comfortable lifestyle awaits in this 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, priced at 1.1 Cr. Spanning 550 square feet on the 5th floor of the 8-story Viraj Nidhi Flats building, this semi-furnished residence offers a pleasant community view.The property includes one dedicated car parking space, a valuable asset in this bustling city, and is over 10 years old,\n\n![Aniket Shirke  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/919833721177638934744251064619.png?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![2.5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dahanukar Wadi](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530834540117-2306261111231123.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530775084741-2306261111171117.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530780016079-2306261111181118.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530784572641-2306261111181118.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530788612641-2306261111181118.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530792723364-2306261111191119.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530797062568-2306261111191119.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at Dahanukar Wadi – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639178530801043353-2306261111201120.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2.5 BHK Apartment at D