ages/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kailash-towers/65987/project","title":"Kailash Towers, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt Ltd developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/midcity-infrastructure-pvt-ltd-8354.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Kailash Towers Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**₹20,293 Per Sq. Ft Onwards**\n\n₹20,293 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Kailash Towers, Kandivali West by MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt Ltd\n\n## Kailash Towers Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Kailash Towers.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  900 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nKailash Towers's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Kailash Towers | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 28200 | 26800 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22600 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 28650 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 28650 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nKailash Towers avg. price is ₹ 28.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 26.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 32,000 |\n| [Horizon Green](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/horizon-green/103711/project \"Horizon Green\") | ₹ 30,200 |\n| Current Project **Kailash Towers** | ₹ 28,200 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 26,800 |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Kailash Towers.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 3 residential transactions has been registered so far for Kailash Towers, amounting to ₹ 4 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Kailash Towers moved from ₹ 22,600/sqft to ₹ 28,200/sqft, reflecting a 24.78% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n3 Sales Transactions Registered in Kailash Towers From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 17.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | ₹ 4 Cr | ₹ 17,950 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Kailash Towers Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 900 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kailash Towers, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale Listings in Kailash Towers\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Kailash Towers, Mumbai.\n\n![3 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Kailash Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Kailash Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Kailash Towers in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![Sunil Ransure]()\n\nClassic Property\n\n![Nirav Shah]()\n\nRiddhi Estate Consultant\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Kailash Towers\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt Ltd Kandivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-71