64, \"Parking Area in Kailash Tower\")\n![Lobby Entrance to Building in Kailash Tower](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lobby Entrance to Building in Kailash Tower\")\n![View from Gate in Kailash Tower](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"View from Gate in Kailash Tower\")\n![Kailash Tower photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kailash Tower photos 1\")\n![Kailash Tower photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kailash Tower photos 2\")\n![Kailash Tower photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kailash Tower photos 3\")\n![Kailash Tower photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kailash Tower photos 4\")\n![Kailash Tower photos 5](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kailash Tower photos 5\")\n\n## About [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Kandivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kandivali West\")\n\n## About MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.\n\n![MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. is amalgamation of various companies of ORBIT GROUP that were functioning independently. In order to bring everything under one roof as also to augment the net worth of our firm, new corporate identity took shape  Today, MIDCITY Infrastructure has inherited all good qualities of erstwhile ORBIT GROUP and continues to thrive on the niche carved out by its predecessor. MIDCITY has achieved a rare distinction of being 9001-2008 certified company. Very few organizations have obtained this certification and many know little about 9001-2008 certification.    In today’s market, when many would shut shop, we at MIDCITY have committed our selves to constructing best homes and commercial places, at prestige locations like BKC, Lokhandwala complex, Andheri West, Veera Desai Road, Juhu Lane, and Marol Andheri East. All this is a result of positive leadership of MD, Mr. Rajen V. Dhruv, along with his team that include, Mrs. Ruby R. Dhruv, Administration, Mr. Hiren V. Dhruv, Construction & Marketing, Mr. Kishore S. Parekh, Materials purchase, Mr. Prakash S. Parekh, sites coordination and other staff members for working towards a single objective of excellence.    A pool of professionals, both In-house and outsourced technical personnel continuously thrive for achieving best results in every project. Some of our completed projects include a high end apartment building GYM VIEW a 12 storey building on 16th Road, Khar, opposite Khar Gymkhana. Nanda Deep, a 12 storey residential building on 16th Road Khar. ANTARIKSH, an 11 storey office building at Marole Andheri East is a landmark in the neighborhoods.    A glimpse at our on going and future projects will indicate our commitment to providing the western suburb with best of buildings, both residential and commercial. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pebble La Serena Tower 5 Tower 6 and Tower 7 photo\")\n![Rock Highland photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Rock Highland photo\")\n![Gagangiri Aadhya photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Gagangiri Aadhya photo\")\n![Shraddha Gold Crest photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shraddha Gold Crest photo\")\n![DPS Nakshatra Heights photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"DPS Nakshatra Heights photo\")\n![Kush Elegante photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kush Elegante photo\")\n![Siddha Seabrook photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Siddha Seabrook photo\")\n![Ruparel Sky Greens photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Sky Greens photo\")\n![Ruparel WestSky photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel WestSky photo\")\n![Bhoomi Sagar Manthan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Bhoomi Sagar Manthan photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by MIDCITY Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd.\n\n![No image available](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"No image available\")\n![MidCity Shikhar ph